<title>FRANCE: Arianespace to launch CD Radio satellites.</title>
<headline>Arianespace to launch CD Radio satellites.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>European rocket consortium Arianespace said on Tuesday that it had signed an agreement with American broadcasting company CD Radio Inc to launch two satellites in 1999.</p>
<p>The launch will use an Ariane rocket from the Guiana Space Centre in Kourou, South America, Arianespace said in a statement.</p>
<p>The launch services will be partly funded by a loan extended by Arianespace Finance, but the statement gave no further financial details.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
